<title>COLOMBIA: TABLE - Coltabaco first half net profit up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Coltabaco first half net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombian cigarette manufacturer Coltabaco reported the following first half results:</p>
<p>	    First half 1997	     First half 1996</p>
<p>Net profit     6.98 billion pesos   profit    5.69 billion</p>
<p>Oper loss	7.19 billion	   loss	1.39 billion</p>
<p>Total assets 576.4 billion			463.9 billion</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Colombian pesos and subject to verification by the Securities Superintendency.</p>
<p>((-- Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
